1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Namaste doston! Is video mein hum seekhenge TallyPrime.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Ekdum shuru se — A to Z — kaise download aur install karte hain.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Agar aapne Tally kabhi use nahi kiya, bilkul tension mat lijiye.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Main har step simple Hindi mein, screen par dikhate hue samjhaaunga.

5
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Pehle samajhte hain TallyPrime hai kya — ye ek accounting software hai.

6
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Ye business ke paise ka hisaab-kitaab rakhta hai: accounting, sales, purchase.

7
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Inventory aur GST ke kaam ke liye bhi. Isi liye students ise seekhte hain.

8
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Yaad rahe: features version aur license par depend karte hain.

9
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:07,000
TallyPrime sirf Windows par chalta hai — Windows 7 ya upar, 64-bit.

10
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:14,000
Version check karne ke liye Windows+R dabaiye, winver type karke Enter.

11
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Install se pehle apna kaam save kijiye aur extra apps band kijiye.

12
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:22,000
Ab important baat — Tally hamesha official site tallysolutions.com se download kijiye.

13
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:29,000
Cracked ya unofficial site se kabhi mat kijiye — virus aur legal risk hota hai.

14
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:35,000
Address bar mein domain aur lock icon check kijiye.

15
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:22,000
Download page par current version dikhega — jo screen par likha ho wahi dekhiye.

16
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:29,000
Download button dabaiye; ye ek setup file download karega.

17
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:36,000
Complete hone par file Downloads folder mein jaati hai (Windows+E).

18
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:52,000
Security ke liye setup file ka SHA-256 checksum verify kijiye.

19
00:05:52,000 --> 00:06:00,000
PowerShell mein Get-FileHash -Algorithm SHA256 command chalaiye.

20
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:07,000
Value ko official value se match kijiye; Properties se publisher bhi dekhein.

21
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:07,000
Ab setup file par double-click kijiye.

22
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:14,000
Windows permission maangega — User Account Control prompt par Yes dabaiye.

23
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:21,000
Naye user ke liye "Install New" option choose kijiye.

24
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:29,000
Application Path default C:\Program Files\TallyPrime — zyada tar ke liye theek hai.

25
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:37,000
"Install" dabaiye, progress complete hone dijiye, phir "Start TallyPrime".

26
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:43,000
Antivirus ya Windows security band mat kijiye.

27
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:38,000
Tally pehli baar kholte hain. Install karna aur license activate karna alag hai.

28
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:45,000
Startup par jo options actually dikhein unhi ki baat karenge — koi bypass nahi.

29
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:52,000
Educational Mode — ek free, bina-license tareeka Tally seekhne ka.

30
00:10:52,000 --> 00:11:00,000
Limitation: aam taur par sirf 1, 2, 31 tareekh par vouchers (version se confirm karein).

31
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:07,000
Ye payment bypass karne ka tareeka nahi — sirf practice ke liye.

32
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:38,000
Tally khulne par Gateway of Tally dikhता hai aur company banane ka option.

33
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:46,000
Practice ke liye sample company banaiye — real bank/tax details mat daaliye.

34
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:08,000
Agar Gateway of Tally dikh raha hai to installation successful hai.

35
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:16,000
Problem aaye to: dobara official download, Run as administrator, ya PC restart.

36
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:22,000
Fixes ke liye help.tallysolutions.com dekhiye.

37
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:23,000
Common mistakes: unofficial download, galat version, install ko activation samajhna.

38
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:31,000
Education mode ki limits ignore karna, aur backup na rakhna — in se bachiye.

39
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:23,000
Humne seekha download, verify, install, launch aur education mode.

40
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:31,000
Aage seekhiye: company, ledgers, vouchers, inventory, GST aur backup.

41
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:38,000
Video pasand aaye to Like aur Subscribe kijiye. Happy learning!
